    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rival Rampage</strong>\u00a0is an online multiplayer game in which players shoot and drift around the chaotic streets of Strife City, a hub for crime, secret societies, paranormal activities and lots\u2019a *CHA-CHING*! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join a gang of troublemakers and spread anarchy on the streets. With the help of your teammates, a selection of chaos-inducing weapons, and lots of cars out for stealing, explore this city of law and crime and leave your (explosion) mark on the streets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Co-op RAMPAGE game mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a crook, causing chaos in the Strife City and completing tasks given by the Shay Kath. Join your friends and have fun wrecking enemy Cops and get the Job Done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends as a havoc-inducing Crook and fight against the law-abiding Cops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bunch of modifiable weapons to take control of the streets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different cars with various attributes to help you chase or get away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players per game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host your own server or join someone else through the server browser or your friend's list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teamwork is key to getting the job done</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adopt creatures to accompany you on your endeavours</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Rival Rampage</strong>\u00a0is an online multiplayer game in which players shoot and drift around the chaotic streets of Strife City, a hub for crime, secret societies, paranormal activities and lots\u2019a *CHA-CHING*! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join a gang of troublemakers and spread anarchy on the streets. With the help of your teammates, a selection of chaos-inducing weapons, and lots of cars out for stealing, explore this city of law and crime and leave your (explosion) mark on the streets!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>New Co-op RAMPAGE game mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are a crook, causing chaos in the Strife City and completing tasks given by the Shay Kath. Join your friends and have fun wrecking enemy Cops and get the Job Done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play with your friends as a havoc-inducing Crook and fight against the law-abiding Cops</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A bunch of modifiable weapons to take control of the streets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different cars with various attributes to help you chase or get away</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Up to 4 players per game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Host your own server or join someone else through the server browser or your friend's list</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Teamwork is key to getting the job done</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adopt creatures to accompany you on your endeavours</p></li></ul>",
